 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Hair Manipulation — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>Your technique allows you to form your hair into a variety of shapes.</p></blockquote><p>Beginning at 1st level, you have learned to move your hair into different forms using cursed energy. When you take the Attack action, you can spend 1 CE to replace an attack by shaping your hair into a barbed stinger. Make a melee cursed energy attack against a creature within 10 ft of you. On a hit you deal 1d10 + your CE modifier piercing damage. You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls with this attack at 3rd level. This increases to a +2 bonus at 6th level, +3 bonus at 11th level and +4 bonus at 18th level.</p>",
